{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急にスイッチが入ったのでお部屋の片付けをしました⸜( ˆ࿀ˆ )⸝⚑⚐"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のお部屋ではなくリビングですが。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のお部屋は年越す前に片付けするぞ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中飽きて雑誌読んじゃったりテレビ見ちゃったりでなかなか進まなかったけどなんとか片付け終えました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の荷物で散らかってたリビングが今はすっきりしています\\(﹡ˆ﹀ˆ﹡)/うふん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この綺麗さがあと何日続くのであろうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで散らかっちゃうのか未だに謎に包まれてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんどんお部屋が綺麗になりますように!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2Z4E9YK888NTQG997AW0Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい!ふぉ。"}],"source":"archive"}